      "content": "thanks. it's just that even the \"small breaks\" feel like more work now. like i'm just pausing the inevitable. every time i catch my breath, the debt collectors call or my boss sends another email and it's just... it's like there is no version of the future where this actually gets better. it's just a loop of misery. i'm just so done with the struggle.",
